 <!-- panvimdoc-ignore-end -->
 
+### Preview text transforms
+
+Set `require('render-markdown.core.preview').transform` to a callback receiving
+`(source_buffer, source_lines)` and returning converted lines. It runs before
+prose wrapping and table sizing, so the layout measures the actual display text.
+The returned line count must match the source; heading navigation and diagram
+replacement positions continue to use the original source rows. The callback
+must not edit the source buffer. Without a callback, preview behavior is unchanged.
+
 ### Mermaid in terminal previews
 
 The listed preview (`require('render-markdown').preview()`) renders complete
